{"artifactPath":".agents/runtime-monitor.md","byteSize":3228,"content":"# Runtime Monitor

Runtime monitoring closes the gap between written policy and live actor behavior.

## 1. Monitor responsibilities

A runtime monitor watches accepted events and reports:

- sequence violation;
- missing context ack;
- duplicate lease;
- forbidden claim-to-command promotion;
- completion without approval;
- transport result used as semantic approval;
- stale blocker;
- handoff timeout;
- evi

